Get a Founder Pack to join this event and unlock exclusive rewards.

( https://albiononline.com/news/europe-closed-beta-here )

Adventurer,

The *Albion Europe Closed Beta* has begun! This event offers *Albion Europe=
 Founder Pack* ( https://albiononline.com/europe#founderpacks ) owners an e=
arly start in the Beta Challenge and Beta Guild Season - with exclusive rew=
ards available - and a fresh version of Albion with a reduced world size an=
d progression buffs. Read on for details=E2=80=A6

Beta Rewards
------------

The *Beta Challenge* runs until *April 23 at 10 UTC* , and offers every par=
ticipant the opportunity to unlock an exclusive, brand-new vanity set: the =
*Duelist* , which once unlocked will be available to all characters on your=
 account, *on any server*.

Performing open-world activities will grant players challenge points, and a=
s you earn more of these points you can use them to unlock each of the vani=
ty items. As well as being able to start a *full week* before the Open Beta=
 begins, Albion Europe Founder Pack owners will earn points three times as =
quickly, and can unlock a matching mount skin: the *Duelist=E2=80=99s Lynx*=
.

( https://albiononline.com/news/europe-closed-beta-here )

There will also be a one-off *Beta Guild Season* running for the duration o=
f the Albion Europe Beta, with more unique rewards up for grabs for guilds:

* *Custom Guild Logos* : The five guilds with the highest ranking at the en=
d of the season will each get a unique custom guild logo, created in collab=
oration with our art team. These logos will be added to the game after the =
beta, and become permanently available to guilds on all servers.
* *Custom Season Statue* : The season=E2=80=99s top ranking guild will also=
 get their own unique custom guild statue, which will be permanently placed=
 in the open world for all to see.

Boosted Progress
----------------

The Albion Europe Beta features a *reduced-size* version of Albion. The Roy=
al Continent will include only the Highland and Steppe biomes, along with t=
he city of Caerleon, while the Outlands will also be considerably smaller t=
han usual.

( https://albiononline.com/news/europe-closed-beta-here )

All characters will enjoy a number of benefits, allowing them to progress r=
apidly through the game:

* *Premium status* and *2000 Learning Points*
* *+100% Fame* from gathering, farming, and PvE
* *+200% Resources* from gathering and fishing
* *+200% Silver* from mobs
* Resource weight reduced by *66%*

Please also note that the ingame store and Gold Market will be unavailable =
in the Beta.

The Closed Beta is open now, so get a taste of this fresh version of Albion=
 today with an *Albion Europe Founder Pack* ( https://albiononline.com/euro=
pe#founderpacks ) ! As well as granting access to the Closed Beta, the stun=
ning vanity sets in these Founder Packs can be enjoyed *on any server* , an=
d will persist after the Beta. Check them out here:

GET FOUNDER PACKS ( https://albiononline.com/europe#founderpacks )

