<h3>Boosted Progress</h3>

<div>The Albion Europe Beta features a <strong>reduced-size</strong> versio=
n of Albion. The Royal Continent will include only the Highland and Steppe =
biomes, along with the city of Caerleon, while the Outlands will also be co=
nsiderably smaller than usual.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
